From 3205a0eacf5b3ba4e8a9238629f309dfd53b31ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marek Vasut <marex@nabladev.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Jul 2025 11:05:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(stm32mp2): add support for STM32MP23xx/STM32MP25xx DHCOS
 SoM and Breakout Board

This stm32mp25xx-dhcos-som board is a stack of DHCOS SoM based on
STM32MP25xx SoC (1200MHz / crypto capabilities) populated on SoM
Breakout Board carrier board. The stm32mp23xx-dhcos-som is a stack
with STM32MP23xx SoC.

The SoM contains the following peripherals:
- STPMIC (power delivery)
- 4GiB LPDDR4 memory
- eMMC and SDIO WiFi module

The Breakout Board carrier board contains the following peripherals:
- USB-C peripheral port, power supply plug

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Marek Vasut <marex@nabladev.com>
